WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.215
Day 9. One more sound, and a story.

2
00:00:02.665 --> 00:00:09.478
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.978 --> 00:00:13.347
Here is the last new sound, written two ways. Listen.

4
00:00:15.145 --> 00:00:24.547
The second team is the one from day four. In snow it says one sound. In cow, this one. If one does not make a word, your child tries the other.

5
00:00:29.136 --> 00:00:30.230
The word is cloud.

6
00:00:33.185 --> 00:00:34.210
The word is cow.

7
00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:39.666
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

8
00:00:40.116 --> 00:00:42.308
Read the six words of job one together.

9
00:00:42.758 --> 00:00:46.791
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

10
00:00:47.241 --> 00:00:50.144
Find the team. What sound does it make? Then wait.

11
00:00:50.944 --> 00:00:55.704
Then your child reads the three sentences of job two alone, pointing to each word.

12
00:00:56.154 --> 00:01:01.013
There are three small words you tell your child. They are in the grown-up pages at the front.

13
00:01:01.463 --> 00:01:06.473
Then turn to the story. Let your child read it to you, then to someone else in the family.

14
00:01:06.923 --> 00:01:09.618
The pictures are at the bottom, for after the reading.
